Z||000001||Sage||12-25-1999||02:07 PM||||Sorry to hear about your forced change in circumstances.  We have been married 26 years, and it is a constant roller coaster.  Have many friends who were but are no longer.  The divorce rate is over 55%.  Never an easy thing, but the one thing I have concluded that could be considered a "constant" is change.  Know that everything will work out for you sooner or later, and I'm sure if there were anything any of us can do that will ease your transition, we all would be more than willing.  Just know that you at the very least have our moral support.  Hang in there.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||9
